# APT-LABS — environment. Copy to .env.local for local dev, or set in Vercel → Settings → Environment.
#
# Public base URL used by robots.ts, sitemap.ts, the site <meta> tags, and the /brief QR code.
# Leave unset to keep the baked-in Vercel fallback; set your real domain once DNS points at
# Vercel so the public pages advertise the true address.
# NOTE: if set, it must be a valid absolute URL — the metadata calls new URL(...) on it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://apt-labs.vercel.app
